# Reach cut from GMS's 10 to 5. Its hitbox is 390x215 -- one storey of a map,
# holding 5 monsters side by side -- so 10 is a cap GMS never fills and this
# fight would hit every time. See Skill.max_enemies.
#
# 810ms is the animation's own, from the frame data: a beat slower than the
# Spear Sweep it replaces as the Berserker's main attack.
